  "verseCount": 21,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "6",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1SA 6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "6",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Okoiranigwa gw’Esanduki eria y’Omonene",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esanduki eria y’Omonene ekabeera ase ense y’Abafilisti ase engaki y’emetienyi etano na ebere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Abafirisiti bakarangeria abakuani babo na abaringoria, bakababooria, “Ninki togokora ase Esanduki eye y’Omonene? Toteebie ’nchera ki torayeiranie aase aye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Barabwo bakabairaneria: “Onye mokoirania Esanduki eyio ya Nyasae bw’Abaisraeli, timobaisa koyeirania bosa etari nebiegwa; goika momoruere okoruegwa ase engencho y’okomocha. Erio namogwene, naende monyare komanya ng’a nase ki Omonene agendererete kobaa egesusuro.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanto bakabooria, “Inee! Okoruegwa okwo gw’okomocha nkoroki torairanie ase Omonene?” Barabwo bakabairaneria, “Emegwekano etano y’amagumba, na etano ye chimbeba, yonsi eroisirie korwa ase etaabu. Moire emegwekano koreng’ana nomobaro bwe chinyasae chia Abafirisiti, ekiagera amaakwa ayio nigo abeete igoro ase more mwensi, na igoro ase abanene baino boigo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Goika moroisie emegwekano y’amagumba, na eye chimbeba, ebio bigosaria ense yaino; erio motogie Nyasae bw’Abaisraeli. Ande nabo arakore emechando yaino ebe emegusu ase more, na ase chinyasae chiaino, na ase ense yaino.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nase ki mogokong’ia chinkoro chiaino buna Abamisiri na Farao bakong’etie chinkoro chiabo. Inee! Ekero Omonene abaete amaakwa amakong’u tibaete Abaisraeli ribaga bakaruao?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase igo, roisia egari enyia morente chiombe ibere chigokamwa, chitana gosiberwa rikorogoto; mosibere chiombe echio egari eyio, korende morusie chimori chiabo korwa ase chirochio, mochitige ’nka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moimokie Esanduki eye y’Omonene ase egari igoro, na emegwekano eria y’etaabu, mokebeeke ase esanduki eng’ao ebeere ensemo y’Esanduki eria y’Omonene. Emegwekano eyio moyeirere Omonene, erio ebe okoruegwa ase engencho y’okomocha okwo. Magega y’ayio motige Esanduki egende aase aye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio morende: onye ekogenda enchera ya boronge gochia ase ense yaye, nakwo ogoteeba omochie o Beti‐Semesi, rirorio momanye ng’a Omonene otorenteire obobe obwo obonene, korende onye taibo, rirorio tomanye ng’a tari okoboko kwaye gwatoaka; ande nigo twanyora emechando eye mosiabano.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Abanto abwo bagakora boigo. Bakaimokia chiombe ibere chigokamwa, bagachisibera egari, bagasiekera chimori nka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakabeeka Esanduki y’Omonene ase egari, bakabeeka na esanduki eria yabeekire emegwekano eria ye chimbeba na ey’amagumba eroisirie korwa ase etaabu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chiombe chiria chikagenda chikona‐kwana, chikabwatia enchera endonge ekogenda Beti‐Semesi, tichiagobera aande, ensemo y’okorio gose ey’okobee, na abagaambi b’Abafilisti bakaba bagochitunyana korwa magega, goika ase orobebe rwa Beti‐Semesi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bono Abanto ba Beti‐Semesi nkogesa baarenge engano yabo agwo ase rikura, na ekero barigereretie, bakarora Esanduki eria, bakagooka mono.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero egari eria yaigete ase omogondo o Yoshua o Beti‐Semesi egatenenao, ase rigena rinene riarenge. Abanto bagaatia chibao chi’egari eria, erio bakarua chiombe chiria chikaba ekeng’wanso ki’ogosaambwa ase Omonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abalawi bakarusia Esanduki eria y’Omonene, amo nesanduki eria ende yabeekire amo, eyareenge nemegwekano eria y’etaabu, bagachibeeka igoro ase rigena riria rinene. Erio ase rituko riria Abanto ba Beti‐Semesi bakaruera Omonene ebing’wanso bi’ogosambwa na ebing’wanso binde.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero abagaambi baria b’Abafilisti baroche ayio bakairana gochia Ekironi ase rituko riria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abafirisiti bakarua emegwekano eria y’amagumba, eroisirie korwa ase etaabu, ekaba okoruegwa gw’okomocha ase Omonene, omogwekano oyomo korwa ase kera oyomo bw’emechie eyio: Asidodi, na Gasa, na Askeloni, na Gati, na Ekironi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Boigo bakarua emegwekano eria ye chimbeba eroisirie korwa ase chitaabu, oyomo korwa ase kera omochie orenge kogamberwa nabanene baria batano b’Abafilisti, emechie eyio yonsi yagiteire chindwaki na ebichie bionsi bitagiteire. Ne rigena riria rinene ase babeegete Esanduki eria y’Omonene nigo rire kirori goika rituko ria reero agwo ase omogondo o Yoshua o Beti‐Semesi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene agaita Abanto ba Beti‐Semesi emerongo etano na ebere korwa ase Abanto chilifu emerongo etano, ekiagera barigereretie Esanduki eria. Abanto bakaba bakorera na kweumia, ekiagera Omonene aitete Abanto abange ase egati yabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Esanduki y’Omonene ase Kiriati‐Yearimu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Abanto ba Beti‐Semesi bakaboora, “Ning’o oranyare gotenena ase obosio bw’Omonene, Nyasae oyo Omochenu? Nase banto ki aragende gakorua ase tore?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase igo bagatoma Abanto ase baria bemenyete Kiriati‐Yearimu baabateebie ng’a, “Abafirisiti bairanirie Esanduki eria y’Omonene. Tirimboka gocha moyioyie.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "1SA.7",
    "number": "7",
    "bookId": "1SA"
  },
